@startuml
title Institution Administrator Audit Centre
actor "Institution Administrator" as Admin
actor "Other Role" as Other
participant "Unified Workspace" as UI
participant "Audit Centre API" as API
participant "Authorisation Service" as Authz
database "Audit + Security Events" as DB

Other -> UI : Attempt to open Audit Centre
UI --> Other : navigation hidden
Other -> API : direct request
API -> Authz : require audit.centre.read
Authz --> API : deny
API --> Other : 403

Admin -> UI : Open Audit Centre
UI -> API : GET /audit-centre/events(filters)
API -> Authz : require audit.centre.read
Authz --> API : allow institution scope
API -> DB : tenant-filtered event query
DB --> API : events
API --> UI : event cards/table
Admin -> UI : Export filtered evidence
UI -> API : POST /audit-centre/exports
API -> Authz : require audit.export
API -> DB : persist export + SHA-256
API --> UI : count, format, checksum
@enduml
